### Create Region
POST localhost:8080/api/region/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "Toshkent",
  "nameRu": "Ташкент",
  "nameEn": "Tashkent",
  "regionKey": "toshkent"
}

### GET Region All
GET localhost:8080/api/region/get

### GET BY ID
GET localhost:8080/api/region/get/by-id/1

### UPDATE Region By id
PUT localhost:8080/api/region/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 2,
  "nameUz": "Toshkent shahri",
  "nameRu": "Город Ташкент",
  "nameEn": "Tashkent city",
  "regionKey": "toshkent"
}

### DELETE Region By id
DELETE localhost:8080/api/region/delete/1

### PAGINATION
GET localhost:8080/api/region/paging?page=1&size=10

### FILTER
POST localhost:8080/api/region/filter?page=1&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "regionKey": "toshkent",
  "nameUz": "tosh",
  "createdDateFrom": "2026-10-30T20:24:41",
  "createdDateTo": "2026-11-01T16:45:24"
}

### GET REGION BY LANGUAGE
GET localhost:8080/api/region/lang
Accept-Language: RU
